{"id":50346,"date":"2026-04-01T07:30:43","date_gmt":"2026-04-01T06:30:43","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=50346"},"modified":"2026-08-23T22:08:26","modified_gmt":"2026-08-23T21:08:26","slug":"vilamoura-nature-run","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/vilamoura-nature-run\/","title":{"rendered":"Vilamoura Nature Run 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A <strong>Vilamoura Nature Run 2026<\/strong> realiza-se a 2 de maio de 2026, com epicentro na Marina de Vilamoura. Esta prova, pe\u00e7a fundamental no <strong>Calend\u00e1rio Corridas Algarve 2026<\/strong>. Numa co-organiza\u00e7\u00e3o da Free Challenge, Vilamoura World e com o apoio da Junta de Freguesia de Quarteira, C\u00e2mara Municipal de Loul\u00e9 e<br>Inframoura, a <strong>Vilamoura Nature Run 2026<\/strong> tem in\u00edcio agendado para \u00e0s 17h00 em Vilamoura, com partida e chegada na Marina de Vilamoura, nas dist\u00e2ncias de 6 e 11 kms.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\ud83d\udccb <strong>Dados T\u00e9cnicos<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\" >\n<li><strong>Nome:<\/strong> Vilamoura Nature Run 2026<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Data:<\/strong> 2 de maio de 2026<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Local:<\/strong> Vilamoura (Marina), Loul\u00e9<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Terreno\/Dist\u00e2ncias:<\/strong> 6 km (Caminhada) e 11 km (Corrida).<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Sobre o Local<\/strong> Vilamoura caracteriza-se pela sua geografia costeira plana, pontuada por pinhais mansos e zonas h\u00famidas de grande biodiversidade. Para a recupera\u00e7\u00e3o muscular e reposi\u00e7\u00e3o de glicog\u00e9nio ap\u00f3s o esfor\u00e7o, sugere-se a <strong>Cataplana de Peixe<\/strong> ou o <strong>Arroz de Lingueir\u00e3o<\/strong>, pratos emblem\u00e1ticos da gastronomia de Loul\u00e9 e Quarteira que utilizam produtos frescos do mar algarvio.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":50348,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27,559,478,41],"event_type_2":[728,149,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-50346","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-vilamoura-faro","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-de-15-km","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type-meiamaratona","event_type_2-algarve-e-sul","event_type_2-faro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/69cbe5062eb51_Cartaz-cartaz_460.jpg","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/50346","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=50346"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/50346\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":61762,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/50346\/revisions\/61762"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/50348"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=50346"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=50346"},{"taxonomy